      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "引出这种方程，例如："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$5x^2+11x-10=0$，　$x^2-6x+8=0$，",
        "$2x^2+x-1=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "每一个方程的左边是具有一个变量的二次多项式，而右",
        "边是零. 这种形式的方程叫做二次方程."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定义　**$ax^2+bx+c=0$ 这种形式的方程叫做二次方程，",
        "其中 $x$ 是变量，$a$、$b$ 和 $c$ 是某一个数，并且 $a\\neq0$.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x^2$ 的系数 $a$ 通常叫做首项系数，$x$ 的系数 $b$ 叫做第二项",
        "系数，而 $c$ 叫做二次方程的常数项."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程 $3x^2-x-2=0$ 和 $x^2+2x-8=0$ 都是二次方程，因",
        "为它们都具有 $ax^2+bx+c=0$ 的形式. 第一个方程中，$a=3$，",
        "$b=-1$，$c=-2$，而第二个方程中，$a=1$，$b=2$，$c=-8$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "首项系数等于 1 的二次方程叫做简化的二次方程."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，下面两个方程就是简化的二次方程："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x^2+2x-8=0$，",
        "$v^2-0.7v+5.6=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们已经学过用图解法解二次方程. 用图解法解方程",
        "$ax^2+bx+c=0$（$a\\neq0$）时，最好把它写成 $ax^2=-bx-c$ 的形",
        "式. 抛物线 $y=ax^2$ 和直线 $y=-bx-c$ 的交点的横坐标就是",
        "方程的根."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，用图解法解方程 $x^2+2x-8=0$. 为此把它写成下",
        "面的形式："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x^2=8-2x$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由公式 $y=x^2$ 和 $y=8-2x$ 给出的函数的图象相交于点",
        "$A$ 和 $B$，它们的横坐标相应地等于 $-4$ 和 2（图 58）. $-4$ 和 2"
      ]
    },
    {
